Диаграмма классов (Class Diagram)

@startuml OnlineCinema_Classes
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum UserRole {
    USER
    ADMIN
}

class User {
    - id: int
    - email: str
    - username: str
    - password_hash: str
    - role: UserRole
    - is_subscribed: bool
    + check_password(password: str): bool
    + update_subscription(status: bool): void
}

class MediaItem {
    - id: int
    - title: str
    - description: str
    - genres: List<str>
    - year: int
    - rating: float
    - video_url: str
    - is_hidden: bool
    + get_short_info(): dict
}

class Review {
    - id: int
    - user_id: int
    - media_id: int
    - score: int
    - comment: str
    - created_at: str
    + validate_score(): bool
}

class ChatMessage {
    - id: int
    - sender_name: str
    - message_text: str
    - timestamp: str
}

class PlaybackState {
    + is_playing: bool
    + current_time_sec: float
    + last_updated_epoch: float
}

class WatchRoom {
    - room_id: str
    - host_user_id: int
    - media_item: MediaItem
    - state: PlaybackState
    - chat_history: List<ChatMessage>
    + join_member(user: User): bool
    + leave_member(user: User): void
    + update_playback(is_playing: bool, time_sec: float): void
    + post_chat_message(sender: str, text: str): ChatMessage
    + get_room_state(): dict
}

class RecommendationService {
    + get_recommendations(user: User, limit: int): List<MediaItem>
    - filter_watched_content(catalog: List<MediaItem>, user_id: int): List<MediaItem>
    - rank_by_user_preferences(items: List<MediaItem>, user_id: int): List<MediaItem>
}

User "1" o-- "*" Review : оставляет
MediaItem "1" o-- "*" Review : получает
WatchRoom "1" *-- "1" PlaybackState : состояние плеера
WatchRoom "1" *-- "*" ChatMessage : сообщения
WatchRoom --> MediaItem : транслирует
RecommendationService ..> MediaItem : отбирает
RecommendationService ..> User : анализирует
@enduml


Диаграмма последовательностей (Sequence Diagram)

@startuml OnlineCinema_Sequence
autonumber
actor "Хост (Создатель)" as Host
actor "Участник комнаты" as Guest
boundary "Веб-интерфейс (SPA/HTML)" as UI
control "WatchRoom API / Controller" as Controller
entity "WatchRoom (Сессия)" as Room
database "База данных" as DB

Host -> UI: Нажимает "Пауза / Перемотка на 01:25"
UI -> Controller: POST /api/room/{id}/playback (is_playing=false, time=85)
Controller -> Room: update_playback(false, 85)
Room -> Room: Обновление PlaybackState
Room --> Controller: Состояние обновлено (200 OK)
Controller --> UI: Актуальный статус воспроизведения

Guest -> UI: Периодический опрос/событие комнаты
UI -> Controller: GET /api/room/{id}/sync
Controller -> Room: get_room_state()
Room --> Controller: {time: 85, is_playing: false}
Controller --> UI: Смещение плеера гостя на 01:25 и установка на Паузу

Guest -> UI: Ввод сообщения в чат: "Отличный момент!"
UI -> Controller: POST /api/room/{id}/chat (text="Отличный момент!")
Controller -> Room: post_chat_message(user, text)
Room -> Room: Валидация и добавление ChatMessage
Controller --> UI: Чат обновлен (200 OK)
@enduml


